OL,5,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,6,     FSinger Lucy-Ann Daniels joins
OL,7,     Fconductor George Jackson and the
OL,8,     FBBC Concert Orchestra in music
OL,9,     Fthat has a connection with
OL,10,     FBrighton Dome. Presented by Petroc
OL,11,     FTrelawny.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Jazz Among The British
OL,13,     FGeoffrey Smith concludes his
OL,14,     Fseries on perceptions of jazz in
OL,15,     FBritain with a look at American
OL,16,     Fsaxophonist Sonny Rollins and his
OL,17,     Fassociation with London.
OL,18,G2200 Late Junction
OL,19,     FJoin Verity Sharp as we enjoy the
OL,20,     Fsounds that shaped the musical
OL,21,     Funiverse of vocalist Cara Tolmie.
